   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "efcc2ec4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "*The baseline Logistic Regression model distinguishes non-diabetic cases very well, but its ability to detect diabetic cases is substantially weaker, with 63% recall.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
